    "description": "Let a user create the associated Contact inline during Operator creation. Remove the need to open a separate \"create new contact\" window.\n\n## Implementation Requirements\n\n* Add inline Contact creation to the new Operator creation flow.\n\n* Cover this for the Primary Contact lookup on Operator.\n\n* Keep the flow on one screen. The user should not leave the Operator creation flow to create the Contact.\n\n## Open Questions\n\n* Confirm which Contact fields are needed inline, such as Name, Email, or Phone, versus left for a later edit.\n\n* Confirm if Billing Contact needs the same inline creation, or only Primary Contact.\n\n## Notes\n\n* Flagged as a companion ask in BUILD-264, not built there. This ticket closes that gap.\n\n## Source\n\nEmily Vandenberg, Wagertech feedback — Operator & Partner Record Pages doc, WAGERTECH Feedback OPERATOR section: \"When creating a new Operator we should be able to create the associated contact inline, within the same flow — not require navigating to a separate 'create new contact' window.\"",
