          "body": "Clarification is needed from Emily. Paste this when you’re ready:  \n  \n”When you create a new Operator and need to add a contact, right now it opens a small window to create that contact. You fill it in, save, and it drops you right back into the Operator screen to finish up. It's all one flow, you never leave the Operator creation screen. Is that what you meant by 'inline,' or were you picturing the contact fields sitting directly on the Operator screen itself, no second window at all?\"",
